    "body": "> WebKit and Chromium seem to throw in this case.\r\n\r\nYes, it looks like Blink allows for fragment changes, if I am reading [`CanChangeToUrlForHistoryApi()`](https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/blink/renderer/core/frame/history_util.cc;l=26-46;drc=392417f3b4b58802415ed93368d4ec034e637067) correctly.",
