    "updated_at": "2023-03-01T15:54:26Z",
    "body": "With `git blame` it seems the original code for `equalIgnoringPathQueryAndFragment` is https://codereview.chromium.org/1495013002 from 2015. @mikewest do you know if there was a webcompat reason to ignore query and fragment? Allow overriding the query for opaque origins seems like it's about as much of an issue as allow overriding the path.",
