    "body": "https://codereview.chromium.org/1495013002#msg6 is a better record of what I was thinking at the time than I have in my head at the moment. :) I don't recall any compatibility concerns coming into play, and I was apparently looking to whatever HTML said 8 years ago along with spot-checks of Firefox's behavior.",
